keywords:
  - code review
  - reviewer recommendation
  - knowledge units
  - large language models
  - GitHub App
  - vector similarity
abstract: >-
  ReviewerMatch is a GitHub App that automatically suggests the best code
  reviewers when a pull request is opened. It builds reviewer expertise
  profiles from historical review comments using LLM-based extraction of
  17 JavaScript Knowledge Units (KUs) with frequency weighting, and ranks
  candidate reviewers with a hybrid score combining KU frequency match,
  experience level, review activity, and FAISS vector similarity to past
  pull requests.
